<h1 id="wiki_astra_malorum_.7C_complete_map_breakdown">Astra Malorum | Complete Map Breakdown</h1>
<p>This guide is broken down into <strong>Chapters</strong> and <strong>Topics</strong>, a Chapter defines the content of the Topics to make all of the guides easier to navigate and read.</p>
<p>On PC, there is a list of all the <strong>Chapters</strong> on the right. Just click on the text and the site will take you there. Alternatively, to find specific information, press <strong>CTRL + F</strong> and type the information you want to find. On mobile, the list of all the <strong>Chapters and Topics</strong> is at the top of the page.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><strong><img alt="" class="wiki-img-none wiki-img-no-wrap wiki-img-in-table" data-height="1080" data-media-id="vrzo1oc0lu2g1" data-width="1920" height="1080" width="1920" src="https://preview.redd.it/vrzo1oc0lu2g1.png?width=1920&height=1080&format=png&auto=webp&s=e145b9a50f89d4e6bd00fe457ab19f394af88af5"></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><strong><em>In the cold depths of space, a century-old observatory guards a gateway to a dead world. Awaken the astronomer, defeat the mechanical guard, and liberate the celestial Shadowsmith!</em></strong></p>
<hr>
<h1 id="wiki_key_features">Key Features</h1>
<p>This is a walkthrough of the key features of the map, such as Pack-a-Punch, Wonder Weapons, etc.</p>
