<ol>
<li>TBD</li>
</ol></div>
<div class="glass-card glass-amber"><h2 id="wiki_lgm.2D1"><label class="g-toggle"><input type="checkbox" class="g-cb" checked><span class="g-title">LGM-1<span class="g-tag">🔫 LGM-1</span></span><span class="g-chev" aria-hidden="true"></span></label></h2>
<ol>
<li>Collect several items:
<ol>
<li>Destroy one of O.S.C.A.R. flying drones to obtain the Damaged Drone.</li>
<li>Find a blinking lamp post around the map and shoot it to drop the Aberrant Wiring.</li>
<li>Equipped with a Pack-a-Punched gun, shoot the gearbox of Ol' Tessie in Crash Site to collect the Car Battery.</li>
<li>With Cryofreeze equipped, find and shoot an Aether Crystal around the map to drop an Absolute Zero Shard. You need to collect a total of 3 shards.</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>Kill O.S.C.A.R. using three different traps. <strong>This can be done in any order, but only one can be done per round.</strong>
<ol>
<li>Place the Absolute Zero Shard inside the rocket thrusters in Museum Infinitum. If done correctly, a countdown will be heard. Activate the trap and bring O.S.C.A.R. to the rocket thrusters to kill it.<img alt="" class="wiki-img-right wiki-img-with-wrap wiki-img-in-table" data-height="930" data-media-id="zpff20px6g5g1" data-width="855" height="256" width="235" src="https://preview.redd.it/zpff20px6g5g1.png?width=320&height=348&format=png&auto=webp&s=41036b5a09afab96e073db914c3f7a10488cc958"></li>
<li>Place the Damaged Drone, Car Battery and Aberrant Wiring inside the trap at the Luminarium to enable the Electro-Volt Projector. Bring O.S.C.A.R. inside the room and interact with the trap to kill it. Players have to hold O.S.C.A.R. within the room until it overheats and explodes. Purple-eyed zombies will also spawn during this step.</li>
<li>Inside the Observatory Dome, find and shoot at 5 fuming valves around the room within a limited time. If done correctly, the telescope will start moving.
<ul>
<li>Two are located above the telescope.</li>
<li>Two are located under the telescope.</li>
<li>Three are located on the walls inside the room.</li>
<li>One is located on a pillar behind a sparking box.</li>
<li>One is located in the small room when coming from Machina Astralis</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Bring O.S.C.A.R. beneath the telescope and interact with the organ in front of the Pack-a-Punch machine. A screen will appear and you'll need to place the cursor on the Sun to activate the trap. Make sure O.S.C.A.R. stays within the laser beam to kill it.</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
<ol>
<li>Once all three traps are done, the final O.S.C.A.R. killed will drop the LGM-1.</li>
</ol>
<hr>
